A list marker in a raised colon container folds into its open paragraph

```
- head

      :::
      a
- second
.
<ul>
  <li><p>head</p>
    <div>
      <p>a</p>
    </div>
  </li>
  <li><p>second</p></li>
</ul>
```

```
- head

      ::: note
      a
- second
.
<ul>
  <li><p>head</p>
    <aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
      <p>a</p>
    </aside>
  </li>
  <li><p>second</p></li>
</ul>
```

